<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:60%">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left">Award Winning <span class="nowrap">Community College</span> in <span class="nowrap">South Mississippi</span></h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">MGCCC is proud to be recognized as an honor roll recipient by <a style="color:white;" href="https://mgccc.edu/mgccc-earns-2026-great-colleges-to-work-for-honor-roll-recognition/">Great Colleges to Work For<sup>®</sup></a> and as a finalist for the <a style="color:white;" href="https://mgccc.edu/mgccc-earns-national-spotlight-as-aspen-prize-semifinalist/">Aspen Prize for Community College Excellence</a>.</p>
